  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DoctorHelp.NpcDialogueAsset
  content: "Hello, doctor. I feel hot and rather queasy.\nI couldn't finish my toast without wanting to throw up, or keep my mind on the newspaper.\nPerhaps something in yesterday's supper disagreed with me."
